ot\n\nAimbot: Extremely smooth, mouse-movement-based aimbot (undetectable).\n\nSticky Aim: Locks perfectly onto targets without snapping randomly.\n\nTarget Selection: Choose between Head or Chest aiming.\n\nTriggerBot: Auto-fires instantly when an enemy enters your crosshair (Customizable Delay & FOV).\n\nGun Mods (Memory Hooking):\n\nNo Recoil: Removes all weapon kickback.\n\nNo Spread: 100% accuracy, every single shot hits dead center.\n\nInstant Reload: Skips reload animations entirely.\n\nHitbox Expander: Expand enemy hitboxes to never miss a shot (Size & Transparency settings).\n\n👁️ Visuals & ESP\n\nBox & Name ESP: Clean player boxes and nametags.\n\nHealth & Distance: Dynamic health bars responding to player HP and distance trackers.\n\nChams: Red overlay on enemy characters making them pop out from the environment.\n\nFOV Circles: Visual indicators for Aimbot and Triggerbot zones.\n\n🏃‍♂️ Movement\n\nCustom WalkSpeed: Force your speed up to 200.\n\nNoclip: Walk through walls (toggleable via keybind).","tags":["keyless","free","sniper arena"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/Wsw3XNFpJs","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6686f165682d5e41ea472399","username":"haze1337","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ecce083d37d402e1f915728c62ca9e5df1a34da26f59cf7520a778820941ce6d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6686f165682d5e41ea472399-1772456434442.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6686f165682d5e41ea472399","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ecce083d37d402e1f915728c62ca9e5df1a34da26f59cf7520a778820941ce6d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6686f165682d5e41ea472399-1772456434442.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:42:59.724Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[]